rl":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104112#pullrequestreview-3003410136","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104112","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104112#pullrequestreview-3003410136"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104112"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-09T23:41:59Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3285318340,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7D0frE","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?u=a5fd9a203c90bd196083e33bbf0e21324e8c68f8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As stated, I think this fix is welcome. Primarily because even if we find a better solution to the platform rounding errors, this fix stays relevant. This is because `sRGB{0,0,0} == OK_HSL{0,0,0}` is always `true`. We even prevent superfluous calculation here!\n\nIt doesn't mean though that we shouldn't think harder to fix issuers with rounding errors. I just don't think the fix goes against the idea.\n\n---\n\nSmall suggestion.\n\nI would instead edit [thirdparty/misc/ok_color.h](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/misc/ok_color.h) to add that check instead of in `Color`. Seems cleaner.\n\nHere's the `thirdparty/misc/patches/ok_color-0001-srgb_to_okhsl_precision.patch` file if you follow my suggestion:\n```diff\ndiff --git a/thirdparty/misc/ok_color.h b/thirdparty/misc/ok_color.h\nindex 4d0f0049bd..2cc7f1ceef 100644\n--- a/thirdparty/misc/ok_color.h\n+++ b/thirdparty/misc/ok_color.h\n@@ -541,6 +541,11 @@ static RGB okhsl_to_srgb(HSL hsl)\n \n static HSL srgb_to_okhsl(RGB rgb)\n {\n+\t// Fixes some precision errors.\n+\tif (rgb.r == 0.0f && rgb.g == 0.0f && rgb.b == 0.0f) {\n+\t\treturn { 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f };\n+\t}\n+\n \tLab lab = linear_srgb_to_oklab({\n \t\tsrgb_transfer_function_inv(rgb.r),\n \t\tsrgb_transfer_function_inv(rgb.g),\n\n```","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104112#pullrequestreview-3285318340","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104112","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104112#pullrequestreview-3285318340"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104112"}},"submitted_at":"2025-09-30T14:37:06Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3285320970,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7D0gUK","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?u=a5fd9a203c90bd196083e33bbf0e21324e8c68f8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.